#: ../../howto/document-code.rst:1
msgid "Document a codebase"
msgstr "코드베이스 문서화"

#: ../../howto/document-code.rst:4
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A public name needs a contract. Explain its input, its result, its "
#| "ownership, and the conditions under which it fails. A signature alone "
#| "is not a manual."
msgid ""
"A public name needs a contract. We explain its input, its result, its "
